      "content": "it's just that \"moving forward\" feels like a lie... there's no moving forward, there's just more of the same. i'm just so over the struggle. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... have some real peace. like, to just stop the noise and the effort for good. wouldn't it be more logical to just let go instead of fighting a battle i already lost?",
